    "## 2. Scale ablation on the existing 512 px geometry\n",
    "\n",
    "Every SVM hyperparameter search is performed **only inside the training set**. Single-scale models use 10 curvature descriptors each, so the comparison across \\(\\sigma=1,2,4,8\\) is dimensionally matched.\n",
    "\n",
    "The best single scale is chosen by **training CV**, not by validation performance. We then compare it with all four scales using a paired stratified bootstrap.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
