    "## 5. Position *The Starry Night* within Van Gogh\n",
    "\n",
    "Upload a reliable reproduction of *The Starry Night* (JPG/PNG/TIF). The image is processed at 512 px with the **same Phase-I geometry pipeline** used for the corpus benchmark.\n",
    "\n",
    "The output is deliberately descriptive:\n",
    "\n",
    "- robust multivariate distance from the Van Gogh median profile;\n",
    "- percentile of that distance within the clean Van Gogh corpus;\n",
    "- nearest corpus neighbors;\n",
    "- per-feature percentile and robust \\(z\\)-score;\n",
    "- a 2D PCA visualization.\n",
    "\n",
    "This is **not** an authenticity, emotion, intention, or psychological score.\n"
   ]
  },
