    "## 6. Compact scientific readout and package outputs\n",
    "\n",
    "Interpretation rules:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Scale concentration:** prefer training-CV-consistent scale conclusions; do not choose a scale from validation alone.\n",
    "- **Resolution robustness:** descriptor stability is strongest when both rank preservation and ICC are high.\n",
    "- **Artist contrasts:** emphasize effect sizes and FDR-adjusted pairwise differences, not tiny \\(p\\)-values alone.\n",
    "- **Starry Night:** report its corpus percentile and specific geometric departures without converting them into claims about emotion or perception.\n"
